WEBVTT

00:00.200 --> 00:01.600
Sheng'er is right

00:01.920 --> 00:03.040
In all matters

00:03.120 --> 00:04.760
Must consider the bigger picture

00:04.840 --> 00:05.760
Xu'er

00:05.840 --> 00:06.880
Don't focus solely

00:06.960 --> 00:08.840
On military books and training grounds

00:08.920 --> 00:09.440
Occasionally

00:09.520 --> 00:11.840
Also learn your elder brother's way of governance

00:11.920 --> 00:12.840
Yes

00:12.920 --> 00:14.320
Your son has learned
